    "text": "By Braden Bjella ,\n3 hours ago\nIf Delta breaks your bag, you may be entitled to a new one. Here’s how it works. Checking a bag is becoming more expensive than ever. Gone are the days of airplane tickets including checked bags by default—now, if you want to check a bag, you’re likely going to pay at least $35 for the privilege.\nRead full article",
